On lower levels gold is pretty useless.  A potential use for the stuff
would be as bribes to attacking creatures.  Thus any creature that
could wield a weapon could potentially be bribed to become "peaceful"
for a while.  The likelihood of success could be related to charisma,
alignment (?) and amount offered.  After all, isn't it time to give
something back to all those who've given so much?
